QUERY NAME: BBytd
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW tlkpTestCapability.PlanPortfolio, MonthlyOutput.TestCode, MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup, MonthlyOutput.Month, Sum(MonthlyOutput.Volume) AS SumOfVolume
FROM tlkpTestCapability INNER JOIN MonthlyOutput ON (tlkpTestCapability.WorkGroup = MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup) AND (tlkpTestCapability.TestCode = MonthlyOutput.TestCode)
GROUP BY tlkpTestCapability.PlanPortfolio, MonthlyOutput.TestCode, MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup, MonthlyOutput.Month
HAVING ((MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup Not Like "LT*"));

